    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "04. Making Attacks",
    "ruleNumber": "04.00",
    "summary": "Whenever a unit shoots or fights, its attacks are worked out in three numbered steps: Select Weapons (04.01), then Select Targets (04.02), then Resolve Attacks (04.03). The active player carries them out, and for this purpose the active player is whoever controls the unit that was selected to shoot or fight, until its attacks are resolved (01.03).",
